config QCOM_TMELCOM_QMI
	tristate "Qualcomm TMEL Communication QMI Client Infrastructure"
	depends on QRTR && QCOM_QMI_HELPERS
	help
	  Generic QMI-based communication infrastructure for TME-L (Trusted
	  Management Environment - Lite) services over PCIe. Provides QMI
	  client framework for Trestles devices attached via PCIe.

	  Currently supports TME service (0x5F) for attestation, provisioning,
	  and licensing operations. The infrastructure is designed to be
	  extensible for additional TME-L services in the future.

	  The driver provides sysfs interface for monitoring and debugging,
	  and exposes kernel APIs for other drivers to communicate with
	  TME-L services.

	  Say Y or M here to enable TME-L QMI client support.
